          "scope": "Only exact B16 typed polar/factorization/isometry and first adjoint-corrector consumer. No onto ker P or V V.adjoint=I on all ker P, no new H1/B13/B14-floor/small-step/root/gap/unit premise. Rank0/alphaeta1 retained. B17 quantitative contraction, remaining H1/operator inequalities,dynamics/invariance/nonexplosion/hypocoercivity/main/errors/actual-input expected query costs and composition remain open."
